Probably not in full. Under the current vehicle booking terms (version terms-2026-08):

- **Cancel at least 24 hours before departure** for a **full refund**.
- **Cancel less than 24 hours before departure** and you get a **50% refund**.

So if you cancel the day before, the refund depends on the exact departure time. If your sailing is more than 24 hours from now (i.e. after 17:02 on Monday 17 August), you'd get a full refund by cancelling now. If it's sooner, you'd get 50%.

Alternatively, changing the sailing is free up to 24 hours before departure.
